&lt;p style="margin-left: 4px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;当社 社外監査役（現任）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
